{"book":"2kings","num":5,"verses":[{"en":"Now Naaman, captain of the host of the king of Syria, was a great man with his master, and honourable, because by him the LORD had given deliverance unto Syria: he was also a mighty man in valour, but he was a leper.","n":1,"sm":"Naamanu le Suria O Naamanu le alii e pule i “au a le tupu o Suria, o le tagata aoga ia i lona alii, ma le ta'ua lava, aua o la na oo mai ai le manuia mai le Ani i Suria; o ia foi o le toa malosi, a O le lepela ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Naamanu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Suria"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"Naamanu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"alii"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"pule"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"“au"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Suria,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"aoga"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"alii,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ta'ua"},{"en":"","sm":"lava,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manuia"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Ani"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Suria;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"toa"},{"en":"","sm":"malosi,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"lepela"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"And the Syrians had gone out by companies, and had brought away captive out of the land of Israel a little maid; and she waited on Naaman's wife.","n":2,"sm":"Na o atu ‘au a Suria, na latou au mai foi mai le nuu o Isaraelu le tasi teine itiiti O le taua, ua fai ma 11. TUPU 5 auauna a le ava a Naamanu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Na"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"